    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1102-a1">

                <pb facs="1074" n="908" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg908"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure—Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">General Funston to the Adjutant General of the Army
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Fort Sam Houston</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-02-02">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 2, 1917</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Following received from General Pershing from Ojo Federico dated February 1:
                        <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“Reached Ojo today with last cavalry brigade. Camp tomorrow night Espia.
                            Two contingents refugees have reached Palomas. They are being sent
                            Columbus tomorrow morning under guard to be examined by immigration
                            officials. Entire movement progressing satisfactorily.”</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Funston</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
